## 4. Cross-Runtime Compatibility Audit

```yaml
cross_runtime_compat:
  # executor-ts has full type alignment
  executor_ts:
    cri_version: "1.0.0"
    fes_features: "ipoc + capor + racor + fan + race = full"
    types_alignment: "✅ Exact match with Rust (execute_py.core mirroring)"
    note: "TypeScript SDK is the reference for type definitions"
  
  # executor-php has full type alignment
  executor_php:
    cri_version: "1.0.0"
    fes_features: "ipoc + capor + racor + fan + race = full"
    types_alignment: "✅ Exact match with Rust"
    note: "PHP SDK mirrors TS types 1:1 with PHP enums/idioms"
  
  # executor-py (this SDK) bridges Rust and others
  executor_py:
    cri_version: "1.0.0"
    fes_features: "ipoc + capor + racor + fan + race = full"
    mirror_target: "hace-executor (Rust) — 1:1 trait mirroring"
    note: "Python SDK bridges Rust CEP DNA → Python ABCs"
```

